  description: 'If you have 3 or more "Salamangreat" monsters in your GY: You can
    send this card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 "Salamangreat" Link Monster
    in your GY and 1 card in your opponent''s Spell & Trap Zone; return that targeted
    monster from your GY to the Extra Deck, and if you do, destroy the targeted card
    on the field. If a card(s) in your opponent''s Spell & Trap Zone is destroyed
    and sent to the GY, while this card is in your GY (except during the Damage Step):
    You can Special Summon this card in Defense Position. You can only use 1 "Salamangreat
    Foxer" effect per turn, and only once that turn.'
